    "answer": {
      "short": "$20$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}S_\\infty&=\\frac{a}{1-r}\\\\40&=\\frac{a}{1-0.5}\\\\a&=40(0.5)\\\\a&=20\\end{align*}$$",
